## Original Content
फिल्ममेकर कुकू कोहली का 77 साल की उम्र में निधन हो गया. ‘फूल और कांटे’ से अजय देवगन को बड़ा ब्रेक देने वाले कुकू को हार्ट अटैक आया था.

## Summary
Filmmaker Kuku Kohli died at the age of 77 after suffering a heart attack. He is remembered for launching actor Ajay Devgn's career with the film 'Phool Aur Kaante'.

## Key Points
- Kuku Kohli passed away at 77 years old.
- His death was caused by a heart attack.
- He gave Ajay Devgn a significant break in the movie industry.
- He was associated with the film 'Phool Aur Kaante'.


